  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>You&nbsp;can now set a retry policy using Event Hubs or timer triggers that re-executes a function until&nbsp;successful execution or the maximum number of retries occur.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-functions/functions-bindings-error-pages?tabs=csharp#retry-policies-preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more.</a></p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "You can now set a retry policy using Event Hubs or timer triggers that re-executes a function until successful execution or the maximum number of retries occur.\n\nLearn more."
  },
